    │                 ──────┬──────
    │                       ╰──────── returns from the lambda
    │
 22 │         return r
    │                ┬
    │                ╰── this lambda answers `Result<i64, i64>`
    │
    │ Help: write `extend i64: From<str>`, and `?` will use it; or convert it here with `mapErr`
